# Eclipsed Flamekin: "When this creature enters, look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal an Elemental, Island, or Mountain card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order." (CR 701.20a, 401.4) The top four are Flamecore Elemental, Island, Mountain and Forest; the fifth, a Forest, is not looked at.
# Bot1 takes the Flamecore Elemental, revealing it, and the Forest is no card to take: the other three go to the bottom.

